{{apichanges|9.1.0|prev=9.0.5|next=9.1.5}}

==Summary==
* The client now supports loading a <code>MyAddOn_Mainline.toc</code> file and otherwise fall back to <code>MyAddOn.toc</code>.<sup>[https://github.com/Stanzilla/WoWUIBugs/issues/68#issuecomment-889431675]</sup>
* The [https://github.com/Stanzilla/WoWUIBugs/wiki/9.1.0-Consolidated-UI-Changes#event-trace-tool event trace] debug tool been rewritten.
* Transmogrification APIs have been reworked.

